{"id":"27a2cae3c4304ed3","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-rice-area.md","title":"Rice's Theorem Application","display":"prop-rice-area — Rice's Theorem Application","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-rice-area","aliases":["88-prop-rice-area"],"display":"prop-rice-area — Rice's Theorem Application","depends_on":["[[88-df-rice-property]]","[[88-df-index-set]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-rice-area"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-rice-area</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-rice-area — Rice's Theorem Application"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (partial computable function property)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective program numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span> (nontrivial extensional-property predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> (index set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rice\\text{-}area} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\to\n\\forall e,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\varphi_e=\\varphi_d\n\\to(e\\in I_P\\leftrightarrow d\\in I_P)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rice\\text{-}area} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\to\n\\forall e,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\varphi_e=\\varphi_d\n\\to(e\\in I_P\\leftrightarrow d\\in I_P)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Rice 性质在索引集上的饱和性：同一部分函数的不同编号必须同时属于或同时不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>不可判定性本身由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d537b31e66e4fbaf\" href=\"?note=d537b31e66e4fbaf\" title=\"88-thm-rice\">88-thm-rice</a> 给出，本命题不再复制同一结论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-rice-property","status":"resolved","id":"8085e5127aec7739","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"97c2d6a4b728542c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (effective program numbering, see [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-rice-property","status":"resolved","id":"8085e5127aec7739","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rice}(P)$ (nontrivial extensional-property predicate, see [[88-df-rice-property]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"97c2d6a4b728542c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I_P$ (index set, see [[88-df-index-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-rice","status":"resolved","id":"d537b31e66e4fbaf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"不可判定性本身由 [[88-thm-rice]] 给出，本命题不再复制同一结论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"I_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rice\\text{-}area} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\to\n\\forall e,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\varphi_e=\\varphi_d\n\\to(e\\in I_P\\leftrightarrow d\\in I_P)\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"I_P","display":false}],"bytes":1087,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8085e5127aec7739","97c2d6a4b728542c","b955b7851c500bfe","d537b31e66e4fbaf"]}